  "sourceTitle": "Chicken Ginseng Soup",
  "sourceText": "Chicken Ginseng Soup\nBy: Quay Po Cooks\nPublished: Saturday, November 6, 2010 - 8:10am\n\nIngredients\n\n\n\n\n1 piece 200 gm Chicken breast\n6 honey dates\n100 gm ginseng\n900 milliliters water\n\nPreparation\n\n1 Blanch chicken breast and set aside. Add water and ginseng to pot and bring to boil.  Add chicken breast and honey dates and simmer for 2 hours.",
